\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Poll nerves force Ukraine's c. bank to sell dollars  \b0\par\par\uc2 292 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2006\par 14:07\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2006 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 (adds dealer comment)  \par \par \uc2 KIEV, March 24 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  again in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Friday as banks rushed to accumulate dollars two days before a parliamentary election, dealers said.  \par \par \uc2 The bank has sold dollars almost every day this month, staying out of the market this week only on Monday. It has consistently sold dollars at 5.06 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the rate it has defended since August 2005.  \par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is on the market again today. We bought dollars from it," a dealer said. "Demand is here, tension is in the air as the elections get closer and closer."  \par \par \uc2 Ukraine elect on Sunday a new parliament newly empowered to nominate a prime minister. Forty five parties are running, but only five to seven are expected to clear a three percent barrier and win seats.  \par \par \uc2 Demand for hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been rising steadily since the start of the year due to weaker exports and higher prices for Russian natural gas and a desire by some foreign investors to curb their exposure in \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  ahead of the poll.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been committed to keeping the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  at 5.06 in the near term and has defended it against instability linked to the election. The bank has already sold over $1.5 billion from its reserves since the start of the year.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers said they expected new \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  next week.  \par \par \uc2 "I think the situation will not be very different on Monday. The bank will have to step in again. It is already clear the counting process will be long."  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 UKRAINE\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|RBN|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020060324e23o001ei\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
