\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Ukraine's c. bank sells dollars ahead of poll  \b0\par\par\uc2 292 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2006\par 15:47\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2006 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 (adds quotes)  \par \par \uc2 KIEV, March 23 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  staged a fresh \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Thursday as banks rushed to buy dollars three days before a parliamentary election, dealers said.  \par \par \uc2 The bank has been selling dollars almost every day this month, but stayed out of the market on Monday. It sold dollars at 5.06 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Thursday, the rate it has been defending since August 2005.  \par \par \uc2 "Demand is clearly much higher. All dollars are immediately bought out," a dealer said. "For now, there are no sources to put out the fire other than \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ."  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been committed to keeping the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  at 5.06 in the near term and defending it against instability linked to Sunday's election. The bank has already sold over $1.5 billion from its reserves since the start of the year.  \par \par \uc2 President Viktor Yushchenko's team, which rose to power after the Orange Revolution in 2004, faces a big challenge from the Regions Party of Viktor Yanukovich, more sympathetic to Russian interests, and former ally Yulia Tymoshenko.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has said hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  inflow should rise after the election if parliament proves able to form a coalition and choose a new prime minister.  \par \par \uc2 But dealers expected the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to continue \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  even after the poll.  \par \par \uc2 "The question is not whether the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will maintain the rate until the elections but whether it will support the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  afterwards," a dealer said.  \par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is the largest operator and there are no signs on increasing supply for now."  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 UKRAINE\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|E|RBN|RNP  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020060323e23n001hv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
