\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 2- \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine \highlight\uc2  leader vows  \highlight22\uc2 currency \highlight\uc2  stability after vote  \b0\par\par\uc2 431 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2006\par 13:21\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2006 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 (adds c. bank \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers comment)  \par \par \uc2 KIEV, March 14 (Reuters) - President Viktor Yushchenko pledged on Tuesday that Ukraine's fragile \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  would remain stable after a parliamentary election as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  maintained its market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the 10th day running.  \par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate will be stable. It is a big lie that it may slip. I support experts' estimates of the economy ministry and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  that the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate will be stable," he told a news conference.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , kept stable since a revaluation last April, has been hit by political tensions ahead of the March 26 vote.  \par \par \uc2 Ukrainians and some investors fear it may dip after the election, a crucial test of the pro-Western drive iniated by Yushchenko after his election just over a year ago. Under new constitutional rules, parties forming a majority in the chamber will in effect be empowered to choose the prime minister.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  almost daily this month, spending more than $120 million to prop up the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2 . It sold dollars on the market again on Tuesday at 5.06 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 "This is all just pre-election nerves. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has enough reserves to keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  stable if they want to," a dealer said.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , with gross hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves standing at 18.58 billion at the end of February, has repeatedly pledged to keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  stable.  \par \par \uc2 But some investors unnerved by a slow-down of the export-led economy and possible prolonged political instability after the elections have chosen to cut their exposure.  \par \par \uc2 Foreign portfolio investors have cut their holdings in government domestic debt by $192 million since the start of the year. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  estimates non-residents' holdings of government debt at about $1.2 billion.  \par \par \uc2 The economy ministry forecast economic growth will slow to 2.1 percent in 2006 from 2.6 percent in 2005 due to slow investment, a widening trade deficit and a nearly twofold increase in gas prices.  \par \par \uc2 Demand from the hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is also coming from importers and ordinary consumers, dealers said.  \par \par \uc2 A pro-Russian opposition party, Regions of Ukraine, leads opinion polls. The Our Ukraine party, linked to Yushchenko, and a bloc led by former Prime Minister Yulia Tymoshenko, who has fallen out with the president, lie second and third.  \par \par \uc2 Opinion polls show none of the forces will be able to secure an outright majority and coalition talks will be required.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-UKRAINE-\b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 2)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|BNX  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020060314e23e000v4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
