\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 2-Ukraine c. bank supports  \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia \highlight\uc2  as election nears  \b0\par\par\uc2 By Olena Horodetsa  \par \uc2 465 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2006\par 15:01\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2006 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 (adds \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  comment)  \par \par \uc2 KIEV, March 9 (Reuters) - Ukraine's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has sold $120 million in its near-daily \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  so far in March but sees no threat to \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  stability, First Deputy Chairman Anatoly Shapovalov said on Thursday.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the market for the seventh consecutive day on Thursday, selling dollars at 5.06 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  as growing uncertainty ahead of parliamentary elections on March 26 fuelled demand for hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 Lower dollar supply was another factor as Ukraine's main export sectors -- steel and chemicals -- have been hit by higher prices for Russsian gas and lower world prices for their goods.  \par \par \uc2 "People are getting ready for the election. The market is full of \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  and some are trying to convert it into dollars," a dealer said. "I think the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will have to sell not only until the poll but also after it."  \par \par \uc2 But Shapovalov said the market was nearing balance.  \par \par \uc2 "Demand is still a bit higher but it is not critical. The market is practically balanced. We sold $120 million in March," Shapovalov told Reuters. "We do not see any threats to exchange rate stability."  \par \par \uc2 He said there were no reasons to speak about capital flight from Ukraine before the elections, but acknowledged that some portfolio investors were withdrawing profits instead of re-investing them.  \par \par \uc2 "We have non-resident holdings (of government treasury notes) at $1.2 billion. If they wanted to flee we would have had demand not for $20 million but for $500-600 million. I think it is a normal process, if a foreigner wants to leave - he leaves," he said.  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Chairman Volodymyr Stelmakh said this month the bank had enough reserves to keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  stable.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's gross hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves slipped to $18.269 billion as of February 28 from $18.582 billion at the end of January. The bank spent $179 million on \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in February and about $1 billion in January.  \par \par \uc2 POLITICAL UNCERTAINTY  \par \par \uc2 Ukraine's parliamentary elections will be the first public test for the government under President Viktor Yushchenko since it took power after the 2004 Orange Revolution.  \par \par \uc2 Yushchenko's first year in power was plagued by considerable economic slowdown and constant infighting within the government ver important policy issues.  \par \par \uc2 Opinion polls released on Thursday showed that Regions of Ukraine, a pro-Russian party led by Viktor Yanukovich, Yushchenko's defeated opponent in the 2004 presidential poll, is leading with over 30 percent support. The pro-president party Our Ukraine is battling for second place.  \par \par \uc2 (Additional reporting by Natalya Zinets)  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 UKRAINE\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 2)|LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|BNX|RNP  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020060309e2390019f\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
