\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine \highlight\uc2  c.bank in new  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 , reserves slip  \b0\par\par\uc2 By Olena Horodetska  \par \uc2 486 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2006\par 14:44\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2006 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 (Adds more comment, wraps \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  data on reserves)  \par \par \uc2 KIEV, March 3 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Friday for the fourth trading day in a row, selling dollars at 5.06 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  due to rising demand for hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  ahead of a parliamentary poll, dealers said.  \par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is selling dollars again. But today's volumes will not be very big. It is somewhere between $40 and $50 million," a dealer said.  \par \par \uc2 Other dealers estimated volumes of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  as closer to about $20 million a day. They said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold a total of about $100 million during its nearly daily \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  this week.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said its gross hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves slipped to $18.269 billion as of February 28 compared with $18.582 billion at the end of the previous month.  \par \par \uc2 The bank said in a statement it had spent $179 million on its \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in February and about $1 billion in January. The reserves stood at $19.4 billion as of Jan. 1. Demands for the hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is being driven by political uncertainty ahead of the parliamentary elections on March 26, dealers said.  \par \par \uc2 "Many clients are hedging their risks buying dollars. Who knows what will happen at these elections."  \par \par \uc2 Over 40 political parties are running for the election and the right to form a government and name the prime minister.  \par \par \uc2 Ukraine is mired in constitutional uncertainty since a New Year deal sharply increasing the price of imported Russian gas prompted parliament to dismiss the government.  \par \par \uc2 President Viktor Yushchenko ignored the assembly's move. Several ministers have taken an official leave to concentrate on the campaigning.  \par \par \uc2 "Effectively policy making has been held in limbo until the elections. The hope is that elections will clear the way for the formation of a strong, stable government," Tim Ash from Bear Stearns in London said in a research note.  \par \par \uc2 "Unfortunately, opinion polls suggest that none of the leading parties will secure an outright victory. Ukraine appears set for another stint of coalition government."  \par \par \uc2 Surveys show that a party led by Viktor Yanukovich, beaten by President Viktor Yushchenko in the presidential election in 2004 after the Orange Revolution, is leading the polls with about 30 percent of the vote.  \par \par \uc2 Yushchenko's party is the second with some 20 percent of support and the third is the alliance led by charismatic Yulia Tymoshenko, once presidential ally and now rival.  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Chairman Volodymyr Stelmakh said this week the bank was ready to keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  within a corridor of 5-5.06 to the dollar even if demand for the hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rose during the campaign. He has predicted the bank would be able to maintain a steady level of reserves.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-UKRAINE-\b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020060303e2330012k\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
