al bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had no intention of revaluing it after the sale.  \par \par \uc2 He said the bank was ready to buy out the full amount to prevent imbalances on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-UKRAINE-\b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY\b0 \highlight\uc2 |LANGEN|ABN|M|D|RBN|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020051025e1ap00157\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
