\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Ukraine  \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia \highlight\uc2  steady after record steel sale  \b0\par\par\uc2 358 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Oktober 2005\par 09:32\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 (releads with no c. bank \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , adds quotes)  \par \par \uc2 KIEV, Oct 24 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  stayed away from the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Monday with the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  holding steady and ignoring the sale of the country's largest steel mill for a far higher than expected price, dealers said.  \par \par \uc2 Mittal Group , the world's biggest steel producer, secured a 93.02 percent stake in the Kryvorizshtal mill for 24.2 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  ($4.79 billion).  \par \par \uc2 The amount is 20 percent higher than all proceeds received in the years of Ukrainian privatisation and represents about one fifth of the this year's state budget.  \par \par \uc2 "For now, nothing has changed. The tender has taken place. But the economic situation at the moment is such that export revenue is rather low and imports are quite high. All hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  supply is being bought out," a dealer said.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  <UAH=> was virtually flat at 5.044/5.05 per dollar in late trade compared with 5.03/5.055 at the opening.  \par \par \uc2 "There was no particular impact on the market. It is still unclear when the money will come to Ukraine. The finance ministry has also said the investor will not have to convert it into \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," a dealer said.  \par \par \uc2 Finance Minister Viktor Pynzenyk told Reuters funds from the sale would not be placed in a single \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market "to minimise the impact of the approximately $5 billion". Daily trade turnover on the market stands at about $150 million.  \par \par \uc2 He said the government and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  were working on a scheme to allow the winner to pay in hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 Earlier on Monday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  made its standard announcement, saying it was ready to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  at a rate of 5.00/5.06 per dollar.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has stayed out of the market for most of this month. It has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the market only once in October, buying dollars at 5.0 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-UKRAINE-\b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|RBN|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020051024e1ao000je\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
