\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Ukraine C.Bank buys dlrs for first time in a month  \b0\par\par\uc2 298 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Oktober 2005\par 14:30\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 (adds quote, details)  \par \par \uc2 KIEV, Oct 13 (Reuters) - The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Thursday, buying dollars for the first time in a month at 5.0 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  to the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 "The supply of dollars did not exceed demand by much," said one dealer. "I don't think they bought more than $5 million.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers said the purchases came within 10 minutes of the bank issuing its now standard announcement of its intention to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The bank, committed to protecting the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from big variations, last bought dollars in mid-September and has since periodically sold the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  has begun strengthening again due to increased capital inflow after a Eurobond placement last week and ahead of the privatisation tender later this month of the country's largest steel mill Kryvorizhstal.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  <UAH=> climbed to 5.00/40 per dollar at 1300 GMT compared with 5.015/5.05 per dollar on Wednesday and 5.07/5.09 last week.  \par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  is expensive. This can be explained by the forthcoming tender on Kryvorizhstal. Oct. 17 will be the last day for the bidders to make deposits," a dealer said.  \par \par \uc2 Ukraine is selling off Kryvorizhstal for the second time on Oct. 24 after courts ruled its original privatisation illegal.  \par \par \uc2 Bids are accepted until next Monday. The government has already received deposits of about $200 million from several buyers.  \par \par \uc2 Prime Minister Yuri Yekhanurov has said 10 bidders have already submitted documents.  \par \par \uc2 The government also sold a 10-year 600 million euro-denominated bond with a coupon of 4.95 percent on Oct. 5.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 UKRAINE\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020051013e1ad0012s\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
