\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Ukraine's c. bank buys dollars, rate unchanged  \b0\par\par\uc2 302 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 September 2005\par 15:07\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 (adds dealers' comment)  \par \par \uc2 KIEV, Sept 12 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Monday, buying dollars at 5.0 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2 , unchanged from the previous session, dealers said.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which tightly controls the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2 , has previously set the volume for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  at $10 million. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the market nearly daily to keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  stable.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  dipped slightly on Friday after Thursday's sacking of Prime Minister Yulia Tymoshenko. Dealers said volatility was short-lived and the market was calm on Monday.  \par \par \uc2 "Everything was nice and quiet today. We had nearly even dollar supply and demand. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  nearly at the very end of the trading session. Probably, one of the big dollar sellers had some small amounts left," a dealer said.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  <UAH=> was hovering at about 5.01/5.02 to the dollar on Monday compared with to 5.015/5.038 on Friday.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  approved new rules for the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market effective from last week, allowing commercial banks to make forward deals and buy and sell hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the same trading day.  \par \par \uc2 But dealers said their life has not become much easier.  \par \par \uc2 "For me personally, the rules look a bit confusing. They seemed to be written in a hurry and lack clarity. We are reading and digesting them," a dealer said.  \par \par \uc2 The new rules took effect on September 9.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was under increasing pressure from foreign economists and some government officials to free up \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  trade and allow a more flexible \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate, seen as a key tool in fighting rising inflation.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-UKRAINE-PURCHASE (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050912e19c001de\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
