\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Ukraine c.bank buys dollars, rate unchanged  \b0\par\par\uc2 324 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 September 2005\par 14:22\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 (adds comments from dealers, c. bank)  \par \par \uc2 KIEV, Sept 7 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Wednesday, buying dollars at 5.0 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2 , unchanged from the previous session, dealers said.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  tightly controls the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  almost daily over the last month to ward off a sharp rise in the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 It cut the volume for \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  to $10 million from $30 million on Tuesday.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  hopes it will be able to cut the frequency of its \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  once new rules on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market take effect on Friday. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said last week it would allow commercial banks to buy and sell \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the same day and make forward deals.  \par \par \uc2 "Taking into consideration a trend of increased hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  supply to the market, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  took decisions aimed at reducing pressure on the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate. It could be done via further market liberalisation," the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said in a statement.  \par \par \uc2 But dealers were sceptical and did not expect their life to alter dramatically.  \par \par \uc2 "Nothing has changed radically. Many regulations are still in place. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is offering little new," one dealer in Kiev said.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was caught in a dilemma. The bank has to secure the stability of the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  and defend exporters, a major driver behind Ukraine's economic growth.  \par \par \uc2 But it is also under increasing pressure from the International Monetary Fund and some government officials to free up the exchange rate, allowing the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  to rise to help the government fight inflation.  \par \par \uc2 "All the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's steps show only one thing -- they are lost. They have no clear strategy for the next three or five years, even for next year," another dealer said.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-UKRAINE-\b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|BNX  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050907e197001ao\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
