\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 3-Consensus emerges around level of  \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine \highlight\uc2 's hyrvnia  \b0\par\par\uc2 By Ron Popeski  \par \uc2 490 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 September 2005\par 11:38\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 (Adds latest \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 )  \par \par \uc2 KIEV, Sept 2 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2 's leaders on Friday appeared to have reached a consensus on the rate of the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the coming months, ruling out the appreciation some officials had previously demanded.  \par \par \uc2 Prime Minister Yulia Tymoshenko said she saw no grounds for any significant rise in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which has been buying dollars for weeks at a rate of about 5.0 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  to keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  steady, said it would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  as dictated by the economy. It predicted only "minor" variations from a rate of 5.05 to the dollar.  \par \par \uc2 "There will be no major jump in the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the basis of data we now have from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," Tymoshenko told a news conference. "There are no grounds, economic or financial, for upward movement. I am convinced the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  will be stable."  \par \par \uc2 Tymoshenko earlier this year had called for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to ease its grip on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  to allow the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  to rise to fight inflation -- now running at about 14 percent.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers and some Western economists had also viewed a rise in the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rate as inevitable in view of projected capital flows -- from exports and receipts from privatisation.  \par \par \uc2 A \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  statement marking the ninth anniversary of the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's post-Soviet introduction, said its activity on the market "will be appropriate to the economic situation and act as a correction to sharp changes in the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rate.  \par \par \uc2 "Up to the end of the year, minor variations are expected to the current rate of around 5.05 to the dollar," it said.  \par \par \uc2 In the latest trading session, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  at 5.0 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  as it has every day this week except on Tuesday, when it bought dollars at 5.01.  \par \par \uc2 But the bank refrained from its practice, adopted last month, of advising in advance its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate and volumes. The \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  was quoted at at 4.985-4.995 in early trading.  \par \par \uc2 The bank, which keeps tight control of Ukraine's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, has been committed to preventing sharp upward movements in the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  after engineering a three percent rise in a single day in April.  \par \par \uc2 It has also pledged for some time to liberalise rules that bar dealers from buying and selling in a single day, but no action has been taken.  \par \par \uc2 In her comments to reporters, Tymoshenko also said the 2006 budget provided for the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  to be at a level of 5.01.  \par \par \uc2 The Economy Ministry, once an ardent advocate of a strong rise in the value of the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , appeared to abandon its campaign this week by saying it intended to use a rate of 5.05 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  to the dollar in its forecasting for next year.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-UKRAINE-\b \highlight22\uc2 HRYVNIA\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 3)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|BNX  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050902e192000ud\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
